"Secretary" means the Secretary of the committee;
(q)
"stamp" means the Kerala Advocates' Clerks Welfare Fund Stamp printed and distributed under section 14;
(r)
"vakkalath" means a vakalathnama, memorandum of appearance or any other document by which an advocate is
empowered to appear and plead before any court, tribunal or authority.
